{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2023-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1698796800, "end_date": 1701388799, "month_true_total": 17, "quota": 17, "returned": 17, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:10:02 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "152615068", "author": {"steamid": "76561198110013238", "personaname": "loutrec", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/loutrec31225172001/", "num_games_owned": 277, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 156, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 156, "last_played": 1701388623, "avatar": "f8a7ecc33a05eff5ebdf45a875e698c4c717fcd9"}, "language": "english", "review": "it gud funny aliens do RAAAH lil man go pew", "timestamp_created": 1701388713, "timestamp_updated": 1701388713, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152479186", "author": {"steamid": "76561198833326953", "personaname": "Old Snake", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198833326953/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 132, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 132, "last_played": 1678392539, "avatar": "7055584fb53057cb3449dad89eb4b4874e89b8d6"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game feels like a really ♥♥♥♥♥♥ appetizer created by valve before making portal 2. It is a really short game but even within the time, It still doesn’t feel complete and fun. It looks like a really cooperative game needing the tech to be alive throughout the  mission, but it doesn’t live up to that expectation. First of all the game has this interesting reload concept, if you reload you will have to do a quick timed game to reload more quicker, however it seems that failing this game or missing it completely causes you to lose almost all of your ammunition. Another problem is the shortness in the game that I mentioned previously, but didn’t give full context for. There is 1 campaign with 4 or so levels, and that’s it. I figured that this wasn’t a huge project, but this game even with the short amount of time it takes to beat it still doesn’t deliver. Fortunately, it seems the fans have yet again saved a valve game with alien swarm: reactive drop. What seems to be an expanded and patched version of the original. 4/10. Play reactive drop.  \n", "timestamp_created": 1701212758, "timestamp_updated": 1701212758, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.479166656732559204", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152301314", "author": {"steamid": "76561198338237324", "personaname": "NateBagel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198338237324/", "num_games_owned": 201, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 74, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 52, "last_played": 1701224519, "avatar": "b639c96387b72ccb6b0e9a0a944cab7178be188b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun", "timestamp_created": 1701121960, "timestamp_updated": 1701121960, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152153814", "author": {"steamid": "76561199136621403", "personaname": "AtomicFool", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Taminashko/", "num_games_owned":